{
  "_note": "DreamTheater exchanges + greetings (official rebuild 2026-10-14). Wish Gold/Silver Coins are spent at the Wish Fountain (Agnes, module Base\\DreamTheater). Rates = official item texts / video: 10 Wish Twinkle Coins = 1 Wish Silver Coin, 100 = 1 Wish Gold Coin (item 3347478); Flori: 1 Tulip Certificate = 1 Twinkle, 3 Orchid / 3 Lily Certificates = 1, 1 Peony Certificate = 2. Not here (owner decision): the CP shop of Fluffy and the Love Velvet garment exchanges (those garment items have no use handler on this server), the Anima -> 512/256/128 Silver Coin rows (> 40 items per exchange) and the 500/day flower cap.",
  "npcText": {
    "8830000": {
      "ar": "مسرح الأحلام هيعرض أوبرا \"قصة بحيرة البجع\". ساعدني أرجّع المسرح لمجده.",
      "en": "The romantic and beautiful opera `Swan Lake Romance` will be performed at [Dream Theater]. If you can assist me in rebuilding the theater, I will share the profits earned from the performances with you."
    },
    "8830001": {
      "ar": "المسرح بيتجدد. هات عملات Twinkle وأنا أبدّلها لك.",
      "en": "The romantic opera `Swan Lake Romance` is currently in hot performance. You can purchase the latest theater merchandise from me to cheer for your favorite performer!"
    },
    "8830002": {
      "ar": "بدّل شهادات الورد بعملات Wish Twinkle.",
      "en": "Today you can exchange flowers/gifts for Wish Twinkle Coins. If you want more, please use Flower Certificates to exchange."
    },
    "8830003": {
      "ar": "ليون: إنت مدير المسرح اللي أختي عزمته؟ سامحني على قلة الذوق.",
      "en": "Leon: Are you the Theater Manager that my sister invited to manage the theater? Please forgive my rudeness. I heard that my sister hired a love expert to teach me how to win Princess Odette`s heart, so I was a bit impatient."
    },
    "8830004": {
      "ar": "[الحب في كل مكان...] آسفة، كنت لسه سرحانة في الأوبرا.",
      "en": "[Love is everywhere, like the sunlight, like the air, mysterious and noble...] Sorry, I was still immersed in the opera. It was rude of me."
    },
    "32606": {
      "ar": "زمان كنت بطل سباق الزلاجات تلات مرات!",
      "en": "Back in the day, I was the three-time champion of the sled race!"
    },
    "32619": {
      "ar": "زمان كنت بطل سباق الزلاجات تلات مرات!",
      "en": "Back in the day, I was the three-time champion of the sled race!"
    },
    "32608": {
      "ar": "لالالا... لازم أتمرّن على الغنا كل يوم!",
      "en": "Lalala... Don`t mind me. It feels uncomfortable if I don`t practice singing for a day!"
    },
    "32620": {
      "ar": "لالالا... لازم أتمرّن على الغنا كل يوم!",
      "en": "Lalala... Don`t mind me. It feels uncomfortable if I don`t practice singing for a day!"
    },
    "32610": {
      "ar": "الرياضيات صعبة أوي!",
      "en": "Math is so difficult!"
    },
    "32621": {
      "ar": "الرياضيات صعبة أوي!",
      "en": "Math is so difficult!"
    },
    "32611": {
      "ar": "بنتي لازم ماتتأخرش... أسجّلها في أنهي كورس المرة دي؟",
      "en": "My child mustn`t fall behind. What kind of interest class should I sign up my child for this time?"
    },
    "32612": {
      "ar": "ركوب الحصان الكبير ممتع! عايز أبقى أحسن فارس!",
      "en": "It`s so much fun to ride a big horse! I want to be the best knight on the prairie!"
    },
    "32622": {
      "ar": "ركوب الحصان الكبير ممتع! عايز أبقى أحسن فارس!",
      "en": "It`s so much fun to ride a big horse! I want to be the best knight on the prairie!"
    },
    "32615": {
      "ar": "أخيرًا هرجع أمثّل على المسرح!",
      "en": "I can finally continue performing on stage!"
    },
    "32623": {
      "ar": "أخيرًا هرجع أمثّل على المسرح!",
      "en": "I can finally continue performing on stage!"
    },
    "32616": {
      "ar": "اتولدت بشرف وأموت بمجد!",
      "en": "Born in honor, die in glory! Rather break than bend."
    },
    "32624": {
      "ar": "اتولدت بشرف وأموت بمجد!",
      "en": "Born in honor, die in glory! Rather break than bend."
    },
    "32617": {
      "ar": "مياو مياو.",
      "en": "Meow, meow, meow."
    },
    "32625": {
      "ar": "مياو مياو.",
      "en": "Meow, meow, meow."
    }
  },
