  "_fluffy_2026_10_15": "[DreamTheater 2026-10-15] Fluffy [TheaterShop]: CP goods = the official prices of the March 2024 video (spec section 5; the 2024 EmoneySaleShop[32650] rows are gone from this client); Love Velvet 3347321 goods = official costs tWhiteDay2024NPC[3347321] Text114-119 (official: a dialog when the Love Velvet is used; here at Fluffy). The vouchers 3347510-3347515 open from the bag (Base/CastleMystery/CastleStartle.cs). Not here: Elite/Deluxe Flower Pack (contents not in the client), the titles Graceful as Water/Vibrant as Fire (no title item), 'make up with CPs', Chi Points.",
  "_flori_2026_10_15": "[DreamTheater 2026-10-15 video pass] Flori = official dialog (video UQaPh 8:09-8:17): '*Exchange for Wish Twinkle Coins (Limited)*' flowers/gifts (1 Jade/Tulip 1, 3 Beer/Orchids 1, 3 Love Letters/Lilies 1, 3 Kisses/Red Roses 1, 1 Peony/Marble 2; the official cap of 500 Twinkle a day from gifts is not enforced (OPEN)) and '(Unlimited)' certificates + P10/P9/P8 Anima -> 512/256/128 Wish Silver Coins. Love Velvet goods moved to the Love Velvet item dialog (official tWhiteDay2024NPC[3347321]). Fluffy adds Elite/Deluxe Flower Pack 45/420 CPs (video qiOK 12:12 CP Mall)."
